<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH LEAGUE CHAMPIONS SINCE 1956.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH LEAGUE CHAMPIONS SINCE 1956.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
